# Fedora optional/build package list for Omarchy
# Format: one package name per line

# These are packages from omarchy-other.packages mapped to Fedora equivalents or omitted if not needed

autoconf-archive
@development-tools
btrfs-progs
egl-wayland
git
pipewire-gstreamer
gtk4-layer-shell
htop
intltool
iwd
pulseaudio-libs-devel
sassc
snapper
glycin-loaders
wget2-wget
zram-generator

# Omitted/handled by Fedora:
# - webp-pixbuf-loader: retired in Fedora 44. gdk-pixbuf2 carries an Obsoletes tag for it, so the
#   name still resolves, but nothing in Fedora 44 ships a webp gdk-pixbuf loader (the only loader
#   left is libpixbufloader-xpm.so). Image decoding for GTK4 apps moved to glycin, so glycin-loaders
#   above is the replacement that actually renders webp.
# - base, base-devel: replaced by @development-tools
# - dkms: not needed for most ARM64 hardware on Fedora Asahi
# - pipewire, pipewire-alsa, pipewire-jack, pipewire-pulse: pre-installed
# - linux, linux-firmware, kernel headers: handled by Fedora Asahi
# - yay-debug: not needed (AUR helper)
# - limine, limine-mkinitcpio-hook, limine-snapper-sync: Arch-specific bootloader/init
# - broadcom-wl, dart, macbook12-spi-driver-dkms, nvidia-dkms, nvidia-open-dkms, nvidia-utils, lib32-nvidia-utils, libva-intel-driver, libva-nvidia-driver: x86_64/Arch-specific or not needed
